{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10122210","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:6:1012221001:1":{"text":"孩子们，这位姐姐带来的草药可以放心服用，乖乖吃下去，病痛会飞走哦。","source_cn":"孩子们，这位姐姐带来的草药可以放心服用，乖乖吃下去，病...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBCC6B90FEC2762A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012221002:1":{"text":"老师都这么说的话……可是，草药很苦……","source_cn":"老师都这么说的话……可是，草药很苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41CCB6AF0B30E0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012221003:0":{"text":"别怕！只要你喝完药，我就把最喜欢的糖果给你吃！","source_cn":"别怕！只要你喝完药，我就把最喜欢的糖果给你吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5857F7B7D8674B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012221004:1":{"text":"再不喝药，肚子会更痛，你最好听老师的话。","source_cn":"再不喝药，肚子会更痛，你最好听老师的话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x216BC7AF92DA9C5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012221005:1":{"text":"呜……好吧……\n咕嘟咕嘟——果然很苦！","source_cn":"呜……好吧……\\n咕嘟咕嘟——果然很苦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4CDAAEC9B99F82B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"",